<l>ba bi<expan>n</expan>d li<expan>n</expan>d ca<expan>ch</expan> ní do ráid. R.</l></lg>
  
<lg type="quatrain" n="44"><l>I<hi rend="decor">N</hi> ab<expan>r</expan>aim do thestaib <name type="person" nymRef="F64">Fi<expan>n</expan></name>d?</l>
<l>da<expan>r</expan> i<expan>n</expan> Rí ḟuil ōs mo chi<expan>n</expan>d</l>
<l><pb edRef="Laud610" n="fol.125r"/><cb edRef="Laud610" n="fol.125ra"/> ba ferr-som fōs co ba t<expan>r</expan>ī</l>
<l>cid mōr i<expan>n</expan> ní rāidi<expan>m</expan>-si. Rāid.</l></lg>
  
<lg type="quatrain" n="45"><l><hi rend="decor">G</hi>u ba ṡecht do chreid i<expan>n</expan> rí</l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="F64">Fi<expan>n</expan>d m<expan>a</expan>c Cu<expan>m</expan>aill</name> <name type="place" nymRef="a13">Almai<expan>n</expan>i</name></l>
<l>i<expan>n</expan> sechtmad fecht do boí a<expan>r</expan> fás</l>
<l>is dē tāi<expan>n</expan>ic a thiugbás.</l></lg>
  
<lg type="quatrain" n="46"><l><name type="place" nymRef="l32"><hi rend="decor">L</hi>eth Moga</name> ac <name type="person" nymRef="E34">Eōgan</name> boí</l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="T13">T<expan>r</expan>énmōr</name> is ré lāi<expan>m</expan> ro lǽ</l>
<l>m<expan>a</expan>c dó<note><p>Written in top marg.(last symbol is unclear; <expan>cenn fo eite</expan>?</p></note> <name type="person" nymRef="C17">Cairill</name> fa gei<expan>n</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="S7">Scāil</name></l>
<l>ba bi<expan>n</expan>d lais ca<expan>ch</expan> ní ro ráid. Rāid’.</l></lg></lg></p>

<p>‘<hi rend="decor">A</hi>drǣ būaid ⁊ ben<expan>nacht</expan>ai<expan>n</expan>, a <name type="person" nymRef="C6">Chaīlti</name>’, a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="D25">Dīa<expan>r</expan>mait m<expan>a</expan>c Cerb<expan>aill</expan></name>. ‘⁊ cāid a filet si<expan>n</expan> ⁊ senchaide <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>enn</expan></name>? Scrībthar i tā<expan>m</expan>lorgaib fil<expan>ed</expan> ⁊ a slechtaib sūad ⁊ a mbrīat<expan>r</expan>aib olloman co <expan>m</expan>b<expan>er</expan>e cāch a chuid lais dā c<expan>r</expan>īch ⁊ dā f<expan>er</expan>an<expan>n</expan> bodēi<expan>n</expan> dā ca<expan>ch</expan> ní da<expan>r</expan>’ i<expan>n</expan>dis <name type="person" nymRef="C6">Caīlti</name> ⁊ <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oissī<expan>n</expan></name> dā mōrgnī<expan>m</expan>a<expan>r</expan>thaib gaile ⁊ gaiscid ⁊ do di<expan>n</expan>dṡenc<expan>us</expan> <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>enn</expan></name>’. ⁊ do-gníd aml<expan>aid</expan> si<expan>n</expan>.</p>
  
